 "description": "Create a browser upload link for media files. ALWAYS use this when the user shares an image or video in chat \u2014 their file is local and cannot be passed directly to publish_content.\n\nWORKFLOW:\n1. Call this tool to get an uploadUrl\n2. Give the user the link to open in their browser and upload their file\n3. After upload, call get_upload_session to get the public media URL(s)\n4. Use the returned URL with publish_content or schedule_content\n\nSupports up to 20 files per session. Expires in 15 minutes.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "properties": {
   "mediaType": {
    "description": "Optional hint for expected media type",
    "enum": [
     "image",
     "video"
    ],
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "type": "object"
 },
 "name": "create_upload_session",
 "outputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": true,
